# The hosts file of the proxy only. The unit binds it over /etc/hosts. The system hosts file does not change.
# The sandbox and the proxy use the name kubernetes.default.svc, which every k3s certificate lists.
# The proxy refuses a loopback address. 10.42.0.1 is the address of the bridge cni0, and k3s listens there too.
# It is the first address of the default pod range 10.42.0.0/16 of k3s. Change it if your k3s uses another range.
10.42.0.1 kubernetes.default.svc
